{"unit_id":"warter666__dsh-compaction-fit#card-zh","repo":"warter666/dsh-compaction-fit","commit":"5b9c4f9f0baa7fa072eb2109deda0b33b46a37d3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-fit 是一个 DSH 上下文压缩插件，通过 llm/stream 中间件在摘要请求发出前估算 token 预算，并按预算截短长文本、工具参数和中间消息组。它会保留系统消息、开头组、最近组及成对的工具调用和结果；遇到尚未输出内容的真实提示超限时，可缩小预算后重试。插件还会在流已含回答且错误符合 pi-ai 特定诊断条件时，将伪造的上下文溢出结束状态改为正常停止。适合使用本地 OpenAI 兼容网关并需要减少摘要请求超限的 DSH 用户；无需额外配置密钥，默认参数可通过 bundle 配置覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:105-118","index.js:142-197","index.js:314-337","cordis.patch.yml:8-22"]}
{"unit_id":"warter666__dsh-compaction-fit#card-en","repo":"warter666/dsh-compaction-fit","commit":"5b9c4f9f0baa7fa072eb2109deda0b33b46a37d3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-compaction-fit adds DSH llm/stream middleware for compaction. It estimates token budgets, trims long text and middle message groups, and retries length rejections with smaller budgets. It can repair a matching pi-ai overflow finish after content arrives. For local OpenAI-compatible gateways.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:105-118","index.js:142-197","index.js:314-337","cordis.patch.yml:8-22"]}
