{"unit_id":"warter666__dsh-compaction-fit#feature-1","repo":"warter666/dsh-compaction-fit","commit":"5b9c4f9f0baa7fa072eb2109deda0b33b46a37d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-fit 的功能「按预算裁剪压缩提示」：对 purpose 为 compaction 的请求估算上下文预算；超出时缩短长文本、推理块和工具参数，再省略中间消息组并插入说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:314-337","index.js:339-378","index.js:400-459"]}
{"unit_id":"warter666__dsh-compaction-fit#feature-2","repo":"warter666/dsh-compaction-fit","commit":"5b9c4f9f0baa7fa072eb2109deda0b33b46a37d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-fit 的功能「超限后收缩预算重试」：当压缩请求在尚未产生内容时收到上下文或提示过长错误，按收缩比例降低预算并重新发送，次数受 maxRetries 限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:168-188","index.js:245-260"]}
{"unit_id":"warter666__dsh-compaction-fit#feature-3","repo":"warter666/dsh-compaction-fit","commit":"5b9c4f9f0baa7fa072eb2109deda0b33b46a37d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-fit 的功能「保留已到达的完整回答」：若流中已有内容，且结束错误符合无上游状态码或请求 ID 的 pi-ai 溢出诊断，则把结束原因改为 stop 并保留回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:160-178","index.js:237-243"]}
{"unit_id":"warter666__dsh-compaction-fit#feature-4","repo":"warter666/dsh-compaction-fit","commit":"5b9c4f9f0baa7fa072eb2109deda0b33b46a37d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-fit 的功能「按模型路由解析预算」：优先使用 provider/model 的显式预算；否则结合模型声明窗口和进程内观察到的成功提示长度计算预算。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:390-423"]}
{"unit_id":"warter666__dsh-compaction-fit#caveat-1","repo":"warter666/dsh-compaction-fit","commit":"5b9c4f9f0baa7fa072eb2109deda0b33b46a37d3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-fit 使用启发式 token 估算而非上游 tokenizer；裁剪时可能省略中间消息组，因此本次摘要不会包含被省略部分的细节。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:464-477","index.js:339-378"]}
